  "steps": [
    "Season chicken with garlic powder, oregano, salt and pepper. Fry in oil on medium-high 1 minute per side; remove and slice.",
    "In the same pan, wilt spinach 1 minute. Mix with cream cheese.",
    "Spread tomato sauce on tortilla; add cream cheese\u2013spinach mix, chicken and mozzarella.",
    "Roll tightly; return to pan seam-side down, fry 1 minute per side until golden. Slice and serve."
